---
// About.astro
---
<section class="section about" id="about">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="about-text">
				<h2>Leading AI & Digital Transformation Consultants</h2>
				<p>
					Founded in 2020, Dummy Website is a boutique consultancy firm specializing
					in helping mid-market and enterprise organizations implement cutting-edge
					AI solutions, automate business processes, and build intelligent digital
					ecosystems.
				</p>
				<p>
					Our team comprises seasoned technologists, data scientists, and business
					strategists who have successfully delivered over 150+ AI projects across
					finance, healthcare, retail, and manufacturing sectors.
				</p>
				<p>
					We don't just sell technology — we partner with you to understand your
					unique challenges and design tailored solutions that deliver measurable
					ROI.
				</p>
				<div class="about-stats">
					<div class="stat-item">
						<div class="stat-number">150+</div>
						<div class="stat-label">Projects Delivered</div>
					</div>
					<div class="stat-item">
						<div class="stat-number">95%</div>
						<div class="stat-label">Client Satisfaction</div>
					</div>
					<div class="stat-item">
						<div class="stat-number">20+</div>
						<div class="stat-label">Industry Experts</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="about-image">
				<img src="/assets/images/meetonex.png" alt="ONEX Team Meeting" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
